  m_Name: NewPrompt 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Locomotion.Narrative.Runtime::Locomotion.Narrative.NarrativePromptAsset
  key: prompt_639139083716782956
  originalText: 'The thing about turning.

    

    The date is 1996. The location
    is rockport maine.

    

    The player is in their driveway staring at the
    sky, it is 5 minutes to sunset.

    

    The player idles.

    

    The
    player walks to the car.

    

    The player gets into the car.

    

    The
    player drives to the beach. If the player gets too far away from the path, the
    scenario restarts.

    

    The player sees a guide path to show them where
    to go.

    

    The player parks in the glowing parking spot.

    

    The
    player takes a picture of the sunset, on disposeable camera:

    right click
    to focus the camera

    left click to take a picture

    The player has to
    scroll the wheel to get a new picture. The player has 17 photos.

    

    The
    player gets back into the car.

    

    The player drives home. The same
    path appears, but if they get too far away, they are back at the beach, however
    it is later and later (10 minutes each time).

'
